/// Job ekspor audit (AC F17-4). Disimpan pada tabel yang sudah ada tanpa tabel job baru; id ekspor dipakai
/// sebagai entity_id audit dengan entity_type `audit_export`:
///
/// | Fakta                       | Ditulis oleh, kapan                         | Isi                                            |
/// | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
/// | audit `audit.export.requested` | API, transaksi permintaan (+ outbox)     | actor admin peminta, created_at, after.filters |
/// | audit `audit.export.completed` | worker, SATU transaksi dengan INSERT files | effective_role system, after {file_id, row_count} |
/// | audit `audit.export.failed`    | worker                                    | effective_role system, after {failure_reason}  |
/// | files purpose `audit_export`   | worker, bersama entri completed            | owner_user_id = akun login peminta, private, status ready, attached_at, expires_at, bytes |
///
